  message: "BRANCH WORK 2026-10-03 (not integrated, no status change): branch jgstern-agent/fix/sofuh, worktree ~/hg_wt/sofuh, commits 4b50aaba1a f09e820bf8 6eae9b63d6 76bd663bfd 5328479c58. smart-test (326 affected files): 10340 passed, 0 failed, 2 xfailed, mypy ratchet clean, changed sources at 100% coverage. Full report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/sofuh.md.\nFix (4b50aaba1a): _ScopeBinder resolves a bare identifier by its enclosing scopes, position-based (INV-mozas); a declaration in scope binds at 0.90, a parameter/local value emits nothing, only an unbound name reaches the old lookups. Also serves callback args, object-literal values, shorthand. Filed repro re-run: a.js:f -> a.js:helper and b.js:g -> b.js:helper at 0.90 with and without package.json; six-extension fixture each own file. Corpus A/B by call site (hls.js/nest/Tone.js/dash.js): 2240/178/38/2567 sites rebound, every sampled production rebind to the caller's own declaration; dash.js loses 6166 edges whose samples were locals/params bound to unrelated same-name symbols. Residual sweep sites (new Foo(), middleware chain) filed as WI-lijin-kozid-lakut-dobif-gutos-goniv-sukav-fuviz."  # 4122
